# The framework parses these byte-for-byte. A CRLF checkout on Windows turns the entry in
# java_init.list into "com.strawing.duckusb.DuckUSBModule\r", which names a class that does
# not exist — the module then installs, enables, and loads nothing, with no error anywhere.
# Same for module.prop's minApiVersion/targetApiVersion values. Pin them to LF.
META-INF/xposed/*      text eol=lf
*.list                 text eol=lf
